5,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us approach this mystery with patience and a kind heart.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Since we have no information yet, the most logical step is to observe everyone's behavior.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the one to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone. Let's keep things harmonious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will be observing. Logic and evidence are the only things that matter here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your energy is wonderful. It will surely keep our spirits high during this trial.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, you seem very focused. I expect your analysis will be useful as the days progress.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm already looking for clues! Does anyone look suspicious to you?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"It's too early for that, Sakura. We should just get to know each other first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Midori is right. There is wisdom in waiting for the truth to reveal itself.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I propose we avoid making any rash accusations until the Seer provides a lead.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, but that's no fun! I want to guess!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Let's follow Mizuki's suggestion. It seems like the safest way to protect the village.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. Rashness leads to errors.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
