31,1,1,talk,Servas,,A new day begins. I hope we can all find a path toward the truth together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first night has passed, does anyone have information they wish to share?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I had a dream that the werewolf was someone really quiet!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Dreams aren't evidence, Sakura. I'm wondering if the Seer has found anything.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very sudden and heavy claim, Ryuji. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"This is absurd. Ryuji, why would you lie so boldly on the first day? You're trying to frame me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,What?! Mizuki is the werewolf? This is getting exciting!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm shocked. Ryuji, are you absolutely certain about this?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"If Ryuji is indeed the Seer, the path forward is simple, though it pains me to see such conflict.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Think logically. If the werewolf wanted to eliminate a threat, they would claim to be the Seer. Ryuji is the werewolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But Ryuji is so serious! He doesn't seem like he's lying!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. Mizuki is usually so reliable, but Ryuji's conviction is very strong.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, your attempt to deflect is a common tactic. The result of the divination does not lie.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe in the clarity of the Seer's vision. I will trust Ryuji.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"You are all making a grave mistake. If you execute me, you lose a loyal villager.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for Mizuki! I trust the Seer!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,I suppose the Seer's information is our only concrete lead. I'll vote for Mizuki too.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The evidence is absolute. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
